diff --git a/features/todomvc.feature b/features/todomvc.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d19d9f9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todomvc.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,217 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want a single-page todo application
+  So that I can track, complete, and organise my work
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with an empty todo list
+
+  Rule: Empty state
+
+    Scenario: Main section and footer are hidden when no todos exist
+      Then the main section is not visible
+      And the footer is not visible
+
+  Rule: Creating todos
+
+    Scenario: A new todo is created by pressing Enter
+      Given the new todo input has focus
+      When the user types "Buy milk" and presses Enter
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+      And the new todo input is empty
+      And the main section is visible
+      And the footer is visible
+
+    Scenario: Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed from new todos
+      When the user types "  Buy milk  " and presses Enter
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+      When the user types "" and presses Enter
+      Then the todo list is empty
+
+    Scenario: The new todo input is focused on page load
+      Then the new todo input has focus
+
+  Rule: Toggle all
+
+    Scenario: Toggling all marks every todo as completed
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then every todo is marked completed
+      And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+    Scenario: Toggling all off marks every todo as active
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      And all todos are completed
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then every todo is marked active
+      And the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+
+    Scenario: Toggle-all reflects the state of individual todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      When the user completes the todo "A"
+      Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+      When the user completes the todo "B"
+      And the user completes the todo "C"
+      Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Rule: Item interactions
+
+    Scenario: Clicking the checkbox completes a todo
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user clicks the checkbox of todo "Buy milk"
+      Then todo "Buy milk" is marked completed
+
+    Scenario: Double-clicking a label activates editing mode
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user double-clicks the label of todo "Buy milk"
+      Then todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+      And the edit input for todo "Buy milk" contains "Buy milk"
+
+    Scenario: Hovering over a todo shows the destroy button
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user hovers over todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the destroy button for todo "Buy milk" is visible
+
+    Scenario: Clicking the destroy button removes the todo
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user clicks the destroy button of todo "Buy milk"
+      Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Rule: Editing
+
+    Scenario: Editing is saved on Enter
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user is editing todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user changes the edit to "Buy oat milk" and presses Enter
+      Then todo "Buy oat milk" appears in the list
+      And todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+    Scenario: Editing is saved on blur
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user is editing todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user changes the edit to "Buy oat milk" and blurs
+      Then todo "Buy oat milk" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: Editing with empty text destroys the todo
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user is editing todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user changes the edit to "" and presses Enter
+      Then the todo list is empty
+
+    Scenario: Pressing Escape discards the edit
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user is editing todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user changes the edit to "Discard" and presses Escape
+      Then todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+      And todo "Discard" is not in the list
+
+    Scenario: Edit input is trimmed before saving
+      Given the user has created a todo "Buy milk"
+      And the user is editing todo "Buy milk"
+      When the user changes the edit to "  Buy oat milk  " and presses Enter
+      Then todo "Buy oat milk" appears in the list
+
+  Rule: Counter
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows the number of active todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      Then the counter shows "3 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter updates when a todo is completed
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      When the user completes the todo "A"
+      Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter uses singular for one item
+      Given the user has created a todo "A"
+      Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows zero items
+      Given the user has created todos "A" and "B"
+      When the user completes the todo "A"
+      And the user completes the todo "B"
+      Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      And the user completes the todo "C"
+      When the user clicks Clear completed
+      Then todo "B" appears in the list
+      And todo "A" is not in the list
+      And todo "C" is not in the list
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no todos are completed
+      Given the user has created todos "A" and "B"
+      Then the Clear completed button is not visible
+
+    Scenario: Clear completed is visible when some todos are completed
+      Given the user has created todos "A" and "B"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      Then the Clear completed button is visible
+
+  Rule: Persistence
+
+    Scenario: Todos survive a page reload
+      Given the user has created todos "Buy milk" and "Walk dog"
+      And the user completes the todo "Walk dog"
+      When the page is reloaded
+      Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+      And todo "Walk dog" is marked completed
+
+    Scenario: Completed state persists across reloads
+      Given the user has created a todo "A"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      When the page is reloaded
+      Then todo "A" is marked completed
+
+  Rule: Routing
+
+    Scenario: The All route shows all todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      When the user navigates to "#/"
+      Then todo "A" appears in the list
+      And todo "B" appears in the list
+      And todo "C" appears in the list
+
+    Scenario: The Active route shows only active todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      When the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then todo "B" appears in the list
+      And todo "C" appears in the list
+      And todo "A" is not in the list
+
+    Scenario: The Completed route shows only completed todos
+      Given the user has created todos "A", "B", and "C"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+      Then todo "A" appears in the list
+      And todo "B" is not in the list
+      And todo "C" is not in the list
+
+    Scenario: The active filter is highlighted
+      Given the user has created a todo "A"
+      When the user navigates to "#/active"
+      Then the "Active" filter is selected
+      And the "All" filter is not selected
+      And the "Completed" filter is not selected
+
+    Scenario: Filtering persists across reloads
+      Given the user has created a todo "A"
+      And the user navigates to "#/active"
+      When the page is reloaded
+      Then the "Active" filter is selected
+
+    Scenario: Toggling a todo while filtered hides it
+      Given the user has created todos "A" and "B"
+      And the user completes the todo "A"
+      And the user navigates to "#/active"
+      When the user completes the todo "B"
+      Then todo "B" is not in the list
+      And the counter shows "0 items left"
